      "title": "Recovery from UK flight disruption ‘will take some time’, as several airports affected – business live",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/business/live/2026/sep/08/oil-price-approaches-100-a-barrel-saudi-attacks-bank-of-england-latest-news-updates",
      "description": "<p>National Air Traffic Services apologise for technical issue disrupting departures today</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/sep/08/air-traffic-control-issue-flights-delays-disruption-uk\">Air traffic control issue causes flight delays and disruption across UK</a></p></li></ul><p><strong>Gas prices are rising this morning, putting pressure on European countries who need to stock up their storage levels before the winter.</strong></p><p>The month-ahead UK gas price is up around 1% at 184p a therm, close to yesterday’s highs when gas hit its highest since January 2023.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/business/live/2026/sep/08/oil-price-approaches-100-a-barrel-saudi-attacks-bank-of-england-latest-news-updates\">Continue reading...</a>",
