    {
      "title": "Air traffic control issue causes flight delays and disruption across UK",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/sep/08/air-traffic-control-issue-flights-delays-disruption-uk",
      "description": "<p>Departures from London airports worst hit as National Air Traffic Services investigates technical problem</p><p>Flights around the UK are facing delays and disruption due to an air traffic control issue which has affected a string of airports including Heathrow and Gatwick and is expected to take “some time” to resolve.</p><p>Departures from London airports are most severely affected, with few take-offs since a fault was reported early on Tuesday afternoon.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/sep/08/air-traffic-control-issue-flights-delays-disruption-uk\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
